\fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1\fs22 To prevent Crew A from having a big time advantage in preparing for sub\-sequent races, Boat #1 (rather than Crew A) should always be called first to the exchange boat\sect }\sectd 
