\par }\pard\plain \s19\qj \li6\ri0\sl-232\slmult0\nowidctlpar\tx725\faauto\rin0\lin6\itap0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1\fs22 Whenever entries total an even number, the \'93direct swap\'94
 system lessens the time for boat exchanges by having pairs of crews change boats simultaneously. The number of races in which each crew follows the same crew is also markedly reduced. For odd numbers of entries, use the \'93follow-the-leader\'94 method.

\par }\pard\plain \qj \li0\ri0\sl-232\slmult0\nowidctlpar\tx725\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \fs24\lang1033\langfe1033\cgrid\langnp1033\langfenp1033 {\f1\fs22 
